            {
                "entry_id": "012b007f-c9b1-3a85-b1fe-68240b7bc217",
                "word": "pandiculation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d25dac98-650e-4bb8-bc09-59a4ea6ef633",
                        "entry_id": "012b007f-c9b1-3a85-b1fe-68240b7bc217",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pandiculations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b6c0f84-2792-39c2-b1c8-7fe60ea3dff8",
                        "entry_id": "012b007f-c9b1-3a85-b1fe-68240b7bc217",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A stretching and stiffening of the trunk and extremities, as when fatigued and drowsy or on waking, often accompanied by yawning."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ee72935-13ee-4156-b29c-2c5c77fe3238",
                                "sense_id": "7b6c0f84-2792-39c2-b1c8-7fe60ea3dff8",
                                "text": "If I were a visitor from another planet - but then, am I not a visitor from another planet? - I think that of all the earthlings' quirks it is the act of pandiculation that would surprise and fascinate me most, that slow stretch and then the soundless ape-howl, in which they indulge themselves with such languorous relish."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "34bcbe88-f4aa-4998-9390-abb31be6a09a",
                        "source_entry_id": "012b007f-c9b1-3a85-b1fe-68240b7bc217",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b6c0f84-2792-39c2-b1c8-7fe60ea3dff8",
                        "source_sense_description": "stretching and stiffening of the trunk and extremities as when fatigued and drowsy",
                        "target_lang_word": "pandiculation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pandiculation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "103ae47a-e626-3d77-9bbf-5a15f34071e0",
                                        "entry_id": "0ae7b8da-7a0b-3eed-b7ee-8d8ffa7160a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action automatique, souvent forcée et accompagnée de bâillements, par laquelle on porte les bras en haut, en renversant la tête et le tronc en arrière et en allongeant les jambes, et qui a lieu ordinairement au réveil, ou lorsqu’on est très fatigué ou près de céder au sommeil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33e4f54a-8887-4096-ad9e-7724c099cd69",
                                                "sense_id": "103ae47a-e626-3d77-9bbf-5a15f34071e0",
                                                "text": "Oh! quel Rêve les a saisies\nDans les pandiculations?\nUn rêve inouï des Asies,\nDes Khengavars ou des Sions?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d63bebd-43c2-491d-824d-24bb308c467e",
                                                "sense_id": "103ae47a-e626-3d77-9bbf-5a15f34071e0",
                                                "text": "Mony arrêta ses exercices de petit salé et regarda la jolie fille grande et potelée s’étirer en pandiculation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
